Here; object-- object, thing; Shivadam-- welfare; Tapa-traya-- three types of suffering; Urmilanam-- to completely destroy;
Shrimat-- beautiful; In Bhagavat-- in Bhagavata Purana; Maha-Muni-- by the great sage (Vyasadeva); Krite-- collected, composed; Kim- what; Va- necessity; Paraih- others; Ishwarah- God; Wel: — Immediately; in the heart;
